CORE
main5.c
--pointer-check --bounds-check --unwind 10 --unwinding-assertions
^EXIT=10$
^SIGNAL=0$
^VERIFICATION FAILED$
^\[main\.assertion\.1\] line \d+ assertion r >= 0: FAILURE$
^\[main\.assertion\.2\] line \d+ assertion r == 1: SUCCESS$
--
^warning: ignoring
--
Converting a wide character may fail, which is an encoding error: the result is
then negative.  The integer conversions cannot fail.
